{
  "_about": "The DeviceProfile Nixie should send with PlaybackInfo on the Google TV emulator (answers: emulator-google-tv-api34-x86.json), written by hand in phase 0 from those measured answers and the plan's rules, as the target for phase 2's profile builder. Its decisions are listed in testing/README.md. Only the fields Nixie sets; Jellyfin fills the rest.",
